    <Element Type="Comment" Id="F971FEC3">
        <Comment>
            Map: Added flame wall doodads
            --------------------------
            Data - Overseer
            Name: Zerg Rally Point
            Sight Radius: 0
            Some abilities removed
            --------------------------
            Behavior: Zerg Rally Ratio
            Buttons: 
            ---------------------------
            Other triggers
            entry_point: add init_3v3 at the end
            create_game: settle_3v3_player
            send_buggo_home: replace Zerg Rally # by command center position
            3 high ground functions: exclude &quot;Zerg Rally Point&quot;
            CC_destroyed: Add 3v3_player_died at the end
            CC_destroyed: don&apos;t destroy other players zerg rally point
            manage_spawners: send all spawners to front if 3v3
            end game: assign victory based on teams
            is_game_over: add a case for 3v3 using is_terrans_team_[bottom|top]_dead
            get_closest_alive_player_position: replace Zerg Rally # by command center position
            handle_idle_unit: if 3v3 and near rally point then move toward command center
            handle weak players every 15s:  is_3v3 or  is_pvp = do nothing
            f2_point: if 3v3 only use unit in correct half of the map
            scout_bonus_gasses: if not 3v3
            attack_a_bonus_gas: if not 3v3
            where_to_place_next_spawner: if 3v3 then split equally between top, bottom and player with least spawners
            get_closest_free_position_to_player_of_type: replace point for distance calculation from Zerg Rally # to CC
            focus_weakest: disabled for 3v3
            upgrade_start_spawners: upgrade 4 random spawners instead of upgrade 4 spawners of the same player
            settle_players: assign position based on player id for 3v3
        </Comment>
    </Element>
